NecroLog is a medical technology manufacturer with heavy ties to the [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]].

On its face NecroLog makes medical machinery and supplies. Through the [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Ghosts]] it is known that the business is a front for moving medicinal and illegal reagents in and out of cities and across borders, the stock for building alchemical bombs. [[People/Donnie|Donovan Hale]] counted a contact in NecroLog among the two people he could lean on about the new firearms from [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]], and the Party told him to use that one.
